## Call order

### Onboarding (once per new user)

```python
seed_tracks(...)           # only if not already seeded
create_user(driver, ...)
assign_tracks(driver, ...)
```

### Start of every session

```python
log_session(driver, user_id, session_id, None, duration_seconds)
```

### After every individual question/exercise response

```python
log_attempt(driver, user_id, session_id, exercise_id, subcategory, ...)   # once per question
```

### End of every session (after all questions in it are logged)

```python
update_weak_phonemes(driver, user_id)
```

